# Scope: papers with at least one author who is a primary-affiliation
# faculty member (current or former) per faculty_details.yml. Secondary
# faculty (Debarati Chatterjee, Swaroop Sahoo) are excluded.
#
# Cross-referencing: `faculty` lists the slug of every department
# co-author (their affiliation IS primary + current/former); `areas`
# lists the union of those co-authors' research areas. A paper with two
# department co-authors from different areas will appear under both.
#
# faculty slugs used (match faculty_details.yml entries):
#   pb-sunil-kumar, uma-divakaran, jayakumar-balakrishnan, prithvi-narayan,
#   soham-manni, kusum-dhochak, bibhu-ranjan-sarangi, projjwal-banerjee,
